      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RHINESTONE (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing sixth (19.82) from Box 6 at Angle Park over 342m. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Should be very hard to beat this time. PAW LEON (5) had to overcome a check in the run but could manage only a distant third (31.19) in a Grade 3/4/5 over 531m at this track. Harder here but expected to feature again. CROYDON REIGN (4) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at Angle Park over 530m behind Victa Spencer (31.59) in a Grade 6. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Has ability and is one of the better chances. KISSES FOR AMY (7) is likely to have admirers.",
